libodin3_abc.so: third-party notices
====================================

libodin3_abc.so, the linked-ABC adapter of Odin III (adapters/abc), contains ABC at commit
a3001b72edc5de22442e942165487fddf150e3d0 (third_party/abc), compiled into it as the static
library libabc-pic. Odin III itself (libodin3, the odin3 core) is MIT-licensed and does not link
ABC.

This file reproduces ABC's copyright.txt and the notice of every third-party component found by
the licence scan of third_party/abc/src that is compiled into libabc-pic (3D spec §4.5, AB-9):
each licence file under src/, and every copyright or licence statement in a source file that the
build compiles or that a compiled directory holds. `odin3 --version` names this file.


